@step Download your notifications and save them locally.
@static aeat app live notifications pull
@blocked live-aeat The app live group reads the operator's authenticated AEAT sede session.
@step List the notification snapshots you have saved.
@static aeat app live notifications list
@blocked operator-artifact Reads notification snapshots captured from the operator's own AEAT account by `notifications pull`; none can be committed as a fixture.
@step View one saved snapshot by its snapshot id.
@static aeat app live notifications view <snapshot-id>
@blocked operator-artifact Reads notification snapshots captured from the operator's own AEAT account by `notifications pull`; none can be committed as a fixture.
@step Show the most recent snapshot in the active profile.
@static aeat app live notifications latest
@blocked operator-artifact Reads notification snapshots captured from the operator's own AEAT account by `notifications pull`; none can be committed as a fixture.
